{%- comment -%}
The index the document states, or the wire name where it states none. The two branches match the
two the class template picks between, and for the same reason: a schema is either wholly keyed or
wholly unkeyed, because a contract that keys one member and not another is a build error on the
server before the document is ever written.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if property.ExtensionData and property.ExtensionData["x-message-pack-index"] != nil -%}
[MessagePack.Key({{ property.ExtensionData["x-message-pack-index"] }})]
{%- else -%}
[MessagePack.Key("{{ property.Name }}")]
{%- endif -%}
